Modifications
** Note that not all modifications are detailed as they are, but they can be easily searched for with the information provided

    adaptive_loop.f90:
    1 relevant difference(s) with respect to standard version
    - Added following snippets, relevant to output of SF/SN information:
    if(SFdiagnostics)then
        write(SFunit_out,'("# LOGS OPENED AT: fine step = ",I7,",  t = ",E12.5,",  aexp = ",E10.3)')nstep,t,aexp
    endif
    if(SNdiagnostics)then
        write(SNunit_out,'("# LOGS OPENED AT: fine step = ",I7,",  t = ",E12.5,",  aexp = ",E10.3)')nstep,t,aexp
    endif

    add_list.f90:
    11 relevant difference(s) with respect to standard version
    - Added a number of lines, all easily identifiable by 'ERIC', 'EDGE2', or related to variables 'nmetals', 'mpb', or 'zp'

    amr_commons.f90:
    1 relevant difference(s) with respect to standard version
    - Added declaration of variables SNunit_out, SFunit_out

    amr_parameters.f90:
    4 relevant difference(s) with respect to my patched version
    - Added declaration of eta_w
    - Added declaration of movie related variables: center_on_particles, do_particle_snapshot, movie_particle_ids, and related

    cooling_fine.f90:
    1 relevant difference(s) with respect to standard version
    - Added calculation of Zolar as ~2 Fe + 1 O (look for 'EDGE2')

    dump_utils.f90:
    2 relevant difference(s) with respect to standard version
    - Added declaration of variable 'met_keys' (2 lines)

    feedback.f90:
    Many (~45) differences with respect to standard version
    copied as is from src_orig
    IMPORTANT: the code required one crucial change to avoid a fatal bug!
    In subroutine 'feedbk', the calling signature of subroutine 'get3cubefather' (declared in  amr/nbors_utils.f90) changed:
    !  old: get3cubefather(ind_cell,nbors_father_cells,nbors_father_grids,ng,ilevel)
    ! new
      call get3cubefather(ind_cell,nbors_father_cells,ng,ilevel)
    The variable 'nbors_father_grids' is thus obsolete.
    There may be other crucial differences like this still, so better to update the feedback.f90 using the updated and patched files.
    - Enclosed call to subroutine 'flush(SNunit_out)' within
        if(SNdiagnostics)then
            flush(SNunit_out)
        endif

    hydro_parameters.f90:
    1 relevant difference(s) with respect to standard version
